{"v":1,"book":"Deut","ch":12,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"These are the statutes and the ordinances that you shall be certain to do in the land which Jehovah, the God of your fathers, has given you to possess, all the days that you live on the earth.","tok":[{"t":"These are the "},{"t":"statutes","s":["H2706"],"a":[1]},{"t":" and the ordinances that you shall be certain to "},{"t":"do","s":["H6213"],"a":[5]},{"t":" in the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[6]},{"t":" which "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[9]},{"t":", the "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[10]},{"t":" of your "},{"t":"fathers","s":["H0001"],"a":[11]},{"t":", has given you to "},{"t":"possess","s":["H3423"],"a":[13]},{"t":", all the "},{"t":"days","s":["H3117"],"a":[15]},{"t":" that you "},{"t":"live","s":["H2416"],"a":[18]},{"t":" on the "},{"t":"earth","s":["H0127"],"a":[20]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":2,"text":"You shall completely destroy all the places where the nations whom you will dispossess have served their gods, on the high mountains and on the hills and under every flourishing tree.","tok":[{"t":"You shall completely "},{"t":"destroy","s":["H0006"],"a":[1]},{"t":" all the "},{"t":"places","s":["H4725"],"a":[4]},{"t":" where the "},{"t":"nations","s":["H1471"],"a":[8]},{"t":" whom you will dispossess have "},{"t":"served","s":["H5647"],"a":[6]},{"t":" their "},{"t":"gods","s":["H0430"],"a":[14]},{"t":", on the "},{"t":"high","s":["H7311"],"a":[17]},{"t":" "},{"t":"mountains","s":["H2022"],"a":[16]},{"t":" and on the "},{"t":"hills","s":["H1389"],"a":[19]},{"t":" and under every flourishing "},{"t":"tree","s":["H6086"],"a":[22]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"And you shall tear down their altars and crush their pillars; and their Asherahs you shall burn with fire, and the idols of their gods you shall cut down; and you shall destroy their name from that place.","tok":[{"t":"And you shall tear down their "},{"t":"altars","s":["H4196"],"a":[2]},{"t":" and crush their "},{"t":"pillars","s":["H4676"],"a":[5]},{"